From fc698a301f8ec39d4c030b4dffb9437686eded38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koldunovn <koldunovn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:50:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] REcoM reference dumps for fesom-jax: hooks around recom(), in
 the tracer loop, the transport fields and the SLP momentum term (no-op unless
 FESOM_RECOM_DUMP_DIR is set)

---
